copyrights.
copyright header
Copyright (c)" "$file"; then Check if the header has a single year equal to the current year (e.g., 2024)
Copyright \(c\) $current_year, RTE \(" "$file"; then continue fi
Copyright \(c\) $year_regex, RTE \(" "$file"; then Replace the second year in the range with the current year (e.g., 2018-2023 becomes 2018-2024)
Copyright \(c\) ([0-9]{4})(-[0-9]{4})?, RTE \(/Copyright \(c\) \1-$current_year, RTE \(/" "$file" else If there's no year range, convert the single year to a range (e.g., 2023 becomes 2023-2024)
Copyright \(c\) ([0-9]{4}), RTE \(/Copyright \(c\) \1-$current_year, RTE \(/" "$file" fi fi </text>

